{"step_index":36,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-31T14:56:08Z","thinking":"**Considering Website Integration**\n\nI'm now exploring the potential of packaging all this content into a simple website. The advantage? I could then use this singular website as a concise introduction to clients. It's a method to streamline communication, allowing for quick sharing of the complete information.\n\n\n**Evaluating Website's Value**\n\nI've determined that creating a dedicated landing page for this content is absolutely brilliant! From a business perspective, the advantages are clear. A web portal looks modern, interactive, and is instantly updatable, unlike static documents. Customers gain interactive access to essential information through specific sections and direct links. It simplifies sales enablement and provides convenient access for IT and decision-makers, boosting their confidence.\n\n\n**Defining Website Content**\n\nI'm now focusing on defining the website's core content and structure to accurately represent DeKai Technology. It will be an Enterprise Sales Landing Page/Product Showcase Portal. My focus is now on ensuring it will have a sticky navigation bar with key elements, and interactive sections for feature comparison, security badges, and local service value. It's becoming increasingly clear how to deliver a concise yet complete solution.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"迪凱科技專用：JetBrains AI Assistant 企業介紹與評估線上網站 (Landing Page / Web Portal)，包含互動模型切換、資安驗證、服務對比與在線試用申請。","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-TW\" class=\"scroll-smooth\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>JetBrains AI Assistant 企業級開發助手 - 迪凱科技 DeKai Technology</title>\n  <script src=\"https://www.gstatic.com/antigravity/web/dev/tailwindcss.min.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap');\n    body {\n      font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n    }\n    .glow-purple {\n      box-shadow: 0 0 50px -10px rgba(147, 51, 234, 0.25);\n    }\n    .glow-indigo {\n      box-shadow: 0 0 50px -10px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.25);\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 antialiased selection:bg-indigo-500 selection:text-white\">\n\n  <!-- Navigation Bar -->\n  <nav class=\"fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50 bg-slate-950/80 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-slate-800/80\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 h-16 flex items-center justify-between\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n        <div class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-500 via-purple-500 to-pink-500 flex items-center justify-center font-black text-white text-lg shadow-lg shadow-indigo-500/20\">\n          JB\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <span class=\"font-extrabold text-base text-white tracking-tight\">JetBrains AI Assistant</span>\n          <span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500/10 text-indigo-400 border border-indigo-500/30 ml-2 hidden sm:inline-block\">台灣官方代理 迪凱科技</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-8 text-xs font-medium text-slate-300\">\n        <a href=\"#overview\" class=\"hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors\">產品總覽</a>\n        <a href=\"#features\" class=\"hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors\">靜態分析與防幻覺</a>\n        <a href=\"#models\" class=\"hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors\">多模型自由切換</a>\n        <a href=\"#security\" class=\"hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors\">🛡️ 資安與數據隱私</a>\n        <a href=\"#dekai-value\" class=\"hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors\">迪凱在地服務</a>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n        <a href=\"https://trust-center.jetbrains.com/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"hidden sm:flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-slate-300 hover:text-white border border-slate-700 hover:border-slate-600 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg transition-all\">\n          <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-400\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z\"></path></svg>\n          Trust Center\n        </a>\n        <button onclick=\"openTrialModal()\" class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 text-white font-semibold text-xs transition-all shadow-md shadow-indigo-600/30\">\n          申請 30 天企業試用\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </nav>\n\n  <!-- Hero Section -->\n  <section id=\"overview\" class=\"pt-32 pb-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto relative overflow-hidden\">\n    <div class=\"absolute top-1/4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-indigo-600/10 rounded-full blur-[120px] pointer-events-none\"></div>\n    <div class=\"absolute top-1/3 right-10 w-[400px] h-[400px] bg-purple-600/10 rounded-full blur-[100px] pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto relative z-10\">\n      <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500/10 border border-indigo-500/30 text-indigo-300 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-6\">\n        <span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse\"></span>\n        高風控企業專用 AI 開發生態\n      </div>\n\n      <h1 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-black text-white tracking-tight leading-tight mb-6\">\n        專為企業打造的<br/>\n        <span class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-400 via-purple-300 to-pink-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent\">\n          可控、可信、多模型 AI 開發平台\n        </span>\n      </h1>\n\n      <p class=\"text-slate-300 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8\">\n        結合 JetBrains 20 年 IDE 靜態代碼分析技術與全球最強 LLM 生態（Claude 3.5 / GPT-4o / Gemini），\n        搭配控制面與數據面分離的安全架構，讓開發團隊生產力倍增，企業資安零死角。\n      </p>\n\n      <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4\">\n        <button onclick=\"openTrialModal()\" class=\"w-full sm:w-auto px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 text-white font-bold text-sm shadow-xl shadow-indigo-600/30 transition-all\">\n          立即申請 30 天 Enterprise 企業試用\n        </button>\n        <a href=\"#features\" class=\"w-full sm:w-auto px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-800 text-slate-300 font-semibold text-sm transition-all\">\n          探索核心功能與優勢 ↓\n        </a>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Trust Badges -->\n      <div class=\"mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-slate-800/80 grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-4 text-slate-400 text-xs\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-2\">\n          <span class=\"text-indigo-400 font-bold text-base\">✓</span>\n          <span>100% No-Training 零訓練</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-2\">\n          <span class=\"text-indigo-400 font-bold text-base\">✓</span>\n          <span>SOC 2 Type II / GDPR 認證</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-2\">\n          <span class=\"text-indigo-400 font-bold text-base\">✓</span>\n          <span>控制面與數據面嚴格分離</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-2\">\n          <span class=\"text-indigo-400 font-bold text-base\">✓</span>\n          <span>迪凱科技台幣開票與在地客服</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Section 1: Static Analysis & Anti-Hallucination -->\n  <section id=\"features\" class=\"py-20 bg-slate-900/40 border-y border-slate-800/80 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\">\n      <div class=\"text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16\">\n        <div class=\"text-xs font-bold text-indigo-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2\">IDE Core Strength</div>\n        <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-extrabold text-white\">靜態代碼分析 (PSI) 杜絕 AI 幻覺</h2>\n        <p class=\"text-slate-400 text-sm mt-3\">\n          傳統點狀 CLI 或輕量外掛常因為「純文字檢索」導致丟失上下文或產生不存在的 API。JetBrains 從根本解決問題。\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8\">\n        <div class=\"bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6 relative overflow-hidden group hover:border-indigo-500/50 transition-all\">\n          <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-indigo-500/10 border border-indigo-500/30 text-indigo-400 font-bold text-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-5\">\n            01\n          </div>\n          <h3 class=\"text-white font-bold text-lg mb-2\">PSI 抽象語法樹預檢</h3>\n          <p class=\"text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed\">\n            AI 在提供代碼建議前，IDE 引擎已先行完成全專案語法樹分析、型別檢查與調用鏈確認，確保生成代碼 100% 可編譯。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6 relative overflow-hidden group hover:border-purple-500/50 transition-all\">\n          <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-purple-500/10 border border-purple-500/30 text-purple-400 font-bold text-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-5\">\n            02\n          </div>\n          <h3 class=\"text-white font-bold text-lg mb-2\">Smart Debugging 異常診斷</h3>\n          <p class=\"text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed\">\n            直連 IDE Debugger 偵錯工具。當系統丟出 Exception 時，AI 自動擷取精確 Stack Trace，給出最符合當前上下文的修正方案。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6 relative overflow-hidden group hover:border-pink-500/50 transition-all\">\n          <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-pink-500/10 border border-pink-500/30 text-pink-400 font-bold text-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-5\">\n            03\n          </div>\n          <h3 class=\"text-white font-bold text-lg mb-2\">視覺化二元 Diff 審查</h3>\n          <p class=\"text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed\">\n            所有的重構與修改均以直觀的二元 Diff 視窗呈現，一鍵比較、替換與撤銷，100% 將代碼控制權留給工程師。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Section 2: Multi-Model Switcher Demo -->\n  <section id=\"models\" class=\"py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto\">\n    <div class=\"text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12\">\n      <div class=\"text-xs font-bold text-indigo-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2\">Multi-Model Freedom</div>\n      <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-extrabold text-white\">不綁定單一 AI 廠商，同一平台自由切換</h2>\n      <p class=\"text-slate-400 text-sm mt-3\">\n        您不需要放棄習慣使用的 Claude 或 GPT。JetBrains AI 原生整合市場最新最強大模型！\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto shadow-2xl\">\n      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mb-8\">\n        <button onclick=\"switchModel('claude')\" id=\"btn-claude\" class=\"model-btn active p-4 rounded-xl border bg-indigo-600/20 border-indigo-500 text-white text-center transition-all\">\n          <div class=\"text-amber-400 font-bold text-xs\">Anthropic</div>\n          <div class=\"font-extrabold text-sm mt-1\">Claude 3.5 Sonnet</div>\n        </button>\n\n        <button onclick=\"switchModel('gpt')\" id=\"btn-gpt\" class=\"model-btn p-4 rounded-xl border bg-slate-800/60 border-slate-700 text-slate-300 text-center transition-all hover:border-slate-600\">\n          <div class=\"text-emerald-400 font-bold text-xs\">OpenAI</div>\n          <div class=\"font-extrabold text-sm mt-1\">GPT-4o</div>\n        </button>\n\n        <button onclick=\"switchModel('gemini')\" id=\"btn-gemini\" class=\"model-btn p-4 rounded-xl border bg-slate-800/60 border-slate-700 text-slate-300 text-center transition-all hover:border-slate-600\">\n          <div class=\"text-sky-400 font-bold text-xs\">Google</div>\n          <div class=\"font-extrabold text-sm mt-1\">Gemini 1.5 Pro</div>\n        </button>\n\n        <button onclick=\"switchModel('mellum')\" id=\"btn-mellum\" class=\"model-btn p-4 rounded-xl border bg-slate-800/60 border-slate-700 text-slate-300 text-center transition-all hover:border-slate-600\">\n          <div class=\"text-purple-400 font-bold text-xs\">JetBrains</div>\n          <div class=\"font-extrabold text-sm mt-1\">Mellum (自研)</div>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n\n      <div id=\"model-info\" class=\"bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-6 text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed\">\n        <h4 class=\"text-indigo-400 font-bold text-sm mb-2\" id=\"model-title\">Anthropic Claude 3.5 Sonnet</h4>\n        <p id=\"model-desc\">\n          擅長極複雜的代碼邏輯推理、架構重構與長文本脈絡理解。可以直接在 JetBrains IDE 編輯器對話框中隨時選用，免去切換工具的麻煩。\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Section 3: Security & Trust Center -->\n  <section id=\"security\" class=\"py-20 bg-slate-900/40 border-y border-slate-800/80 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\">\n      <div class=\"text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16\">\n        <div class=\"text-xs font-bold text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2\">Trust Architecture</div>\n        <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-extrabold text-white\">🛡️ 企業級資安與數據隱私承諾</h2>\n        <p class=\"text-slate-400 text-sm mt-3\">\n          所有的安全與合規條文均獲得 JetBrains 官方背書，完全符合高風控企業稽核標準。\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-12\">\n        <div class=\"bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6\">\n          <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/30 text-emerald-400 font-bold flex items-center justify-center mb-4\">\n            ✓\n          </div>\n          <h3 class=\"text-white font-bold text-base mb-2\">控制面與數據面分離</h3>\n          <p class=\"text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed\">\n            JetBrains Central 管理中樞僅負責授權驗證與點數計費。原始碼在端點 (IDE) 與 LLM 間加密傳輸，管理中樞絕不留存、無法存取核心代碼。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6\">\n          <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/30 text-emerald-400 font-bold flex items-center justify-center mb-4\">\n            ✓\n          </div>\n          <h3 class=\"text-white font-bold text-base mb-2\">100% 零訓練承諾</h3>\n          <p class=\"text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed\">\n            JetBrains 官方及合作第三方 LLM 供應商（Anthropic, OpenAI, Google）簽署法務條約：絕對不會使用您的 Prompt 或程式碼訓練公共模型。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6\">\n          <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/30 text-emerald-400 font-bold flex items-center justify-center mb-4\">\n            ✓\n          </div>\n          <h3 class=\"text-white font-bold text-base mb-2\">30 天自動銷毀 & SOC 2</h3>\n          <p class=\"text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed\">\n            短暫處理 Session 暫存數據最長於 30 天內自動銷毀。基礎設施通過 SOC 2 Type II 認證並完全符合歐洲 GDPR 規範。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto\">\n        <h4 class=\"text-white font-bold text-sm mb-2\">需要查驗 JetBrains 官方 Trust Center 背書？</h4>\n        <p class=\"text-slate-400 text-xs mb-4\">您可以直接存取原廠官方安全門戶，了解各項合規驗證報告與 Data Privacy Policy。</p>\n        <a href=\"https://trust-center.jetbrains.com/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-500 text-white font-bold text-xs transition-all shadow-md shadow-emerald-600/20\">\n          <svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14\"></path></svg>\n          前往 JetBrains Official Trust Center (https://trust-center.jetbrains.com/)\n        </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Section 4: DeKai Technology Local Service Value -->\n  <section id=\"dekai-value\" class=\"py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto\">\n    <div class=\"text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16\">\n      <div class=\"text-xs font-bold text-indigo-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2\">Taiwan Official Partner</div>\n      <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-extrabold text-white\">迪凱科技 (DeKai) 在地 6 大代理價值</h2>\n      <p class=\"text-slate-400 text-sm mt-3\">\n        擺脫坊間「LLM 散買/代購」的帳號密碼資安風險、請購繁瑣與求助無門。\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-12\">\n      <div class=\"bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-6 flex items-start gap-4\">\n        <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-400 font-bold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\">1</div>\n        <div>\n          <h3 class=\"text-white font-bold text-base mb-1\">完全無須提供帳號密碼</h3>\n          <p class=\"text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed\">直接針對貴公司 JetBrains Central Console 進行官方授權與 Credits 充值，資安零風險。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-6 flex items-start gap-4\">\n        <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-400 font-bold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\">2</div>\n        <div>\n          <h3 class=\"text-white font-bold text-base mb-1\">零最低採購門檻限制</h3>\n          <p class=\"text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed\">AI Credits 採彈性充值機制（以 10 USD 為單位起算），用多少充多少，絕不浪費預算。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-6 flex items-start gap-4\">\n        <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-400 font-bold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\">3</div>\n        <div>\n          <h3 class=\"text-white font-bold text-base mb-1\">台灣在地單一窗口</h3>\n          <p class=\"text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed\">出現授權、帳務或技術問題，直接由迪凱科技專員處理，免除海外溝通時差。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-6 flex items-start gap-4\">\n        <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-400 font-bold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\">4</div>\n        <div>\n          <h3 class=\"text-white font-bold text-base mb-1\">合規台幣發票與價格透明</h3>\n          <p class=\"text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed\">提供標準台灣企業報帳發票與透明計費建議，財務部門核銷超輕鬆。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-6 flex items-start gap-4\">\n        <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-400 font-bold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\">5</div>\n        <div>\n          <h3 class=\"text-white font-bold text-base mb-1\">Central Console 部署協助</h3>\n          <p class=\"text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed\">協助 IT 部門一次搞定成員配額分配、權限劃分與資安政策。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-6 flex items-start gap-4\">\n        <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-400 font-bold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\">6</div>\n        <div>\n          <h3 class=\"text-white font-bold text-base mb-1\">單一平台搞定多模型</h3>\n          <p class=\"text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed\">徹底解決「今天買這家、明天充值那家」的混亂，一套工具搞定全公司 AI 生態。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- CTA Section -->\n  <section class=\"py-20 bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-900/60 to-slate-950 border-t border-slate-800/80 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white mb-6\">\n        「你可以不接受，但是我建議你試試看！<br/>\n        <span class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-400 to-pink-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent\">\n          在現今這個年代，試試看往往不吃虧。」\n        </span>\n      </h2>\n      <p class=\"text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-8\">\n        迪凱科技誠摯邀請貴公司開發團隊開啟 <strong>JetBrains AI 30 天免責企業試用</strong>。<br/>\n        我們的專員將於 24 小時內協助開通測試環境並提供完整諮詢！\n      </p>\n      <button onclick=\"openTrialModal()\" class=\"px-8 py-4 rounded-xl bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 text-white font-bold text-base shadow-2xl shadow-indigo-600/40 transition-all\">\n        免費申請 30 天 Enterprise 企業試用 ➔\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Footer -->\n  <footer class=\"bg-slate-950 border-t border-slate-900 py-8 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center text-xs text-slate-500\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4\">\n      <div>\n        © 迪凱科技 DeKai Technology. JetBrains 台灣授權代理商. All rights reserved.\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n        <a href=\"https://trust-center.jetbrains.com/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"hover:text-slate-400 transition-colors\">JetBrains Trust Center 🔗</a>\n        <a href=\"https://www.jetbrains.com/legal/docs/terms/jetbrains-ai/service-agreement/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"hover:text-slate-400 transition-colors\">Legal Terms 🔗</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n\n  <!-- Enterprise Trial Modal -->\n  <div id=\"trial-modal\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-50 bg-slate-950/80 backdrop-blur-sm hidden items-center justify-center p-4\">\n    <div class=\"bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl max-w-md w-full p-6 relative shadow-2xl\">\n      <button onclick=\"closeTrialModal()\" class=\"absolute top-4 right-4 text-slate-400 hover:text-white text-lg\">✕</button>\n\n      <div class=\"text-center mb-6\">\n        <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-400 font-bold text-lg flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3\">\n          JB\n        </div>\n        <h3 class=\"text-white font-bold text-lg\">申請 JetBrains AI 30 天企業試用</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-slate-400 text-xs mt-1\">請填寫基本資料，迪凱科技專員將於 24 小時內聯繫您服務。</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <form onsubmit=\"submitTrialForm(event)\" class=\"space-y-4 text-xs\">\n        <div>\n          <label class=\"block text-slate-300 font-semibold mb-1\">公司名稱 *</label>\n          <input type=\"text\" required placeholder=\"例如：台灣積體電路 / 某某金控\" class=\"w-full bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-slate-200 focus:outline-none focus:border-indigo-500\">\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n          <label class=\"block text-slate-300 font-semibold mb-1\">聯絡人姓名 *</label>\n          <input type=\"text\" required placeholder=\"例如：張經理 / IT 處長\" class=\"w-full bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-slate-200 focus:outline-none focus:border-indigo-500\">\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n          <label class=\"block text-slate-300 font-semibold mb-1\">公司 Email *</label>\n          <input type=\"email\" required placeholder=\"name@company.com.tw\" class=\"w-full bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-slate-200 focus:outline-none focus:border-indigo-500\">\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n          <label class=\"block text-slate-300 font-semibold mb-1\">預計評估人數</label>\n          <select class=\"w-full bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-slate-200 focus:outline-none focus:border-indigo-500\">\n            <option value=\"1-10\">1 - 10 人</option>\n            <option value=\"11-50\">11 - 50 人</option>\n            <option value=\"51-100\">51 - 100 人</option>\n            <option value=\"100+\">100 人以上企業級</option>\n          </select>\n        </div>\n\n        <button type=\"submit\" class=\"w-full py-3 rounded-xl bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 text-white font-bold text-xs shadow-lg shadow-indigo-600/30 transition-all mt-2\">\n          送出申請 (由迪凱科技專員聯繫)\n        </button>\n      </form>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Interactive JavaScript -->\n  <script>\n    function openTrialModal() {\n      const modal = document.getElementById('trial-modal');\n      modal.classList.remove('hidden');\n      modal.classList.add('flex');\n    }\n\n    function closeTrialModal() {\n      const modal = document.getElementById('trial-modal');\n      modal.classList.remove('flex');\n      modal.classList.add('hidden');\n    }\n\n    function submitTrialForm(e) {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      alert('感謝您的申請！迪凱科技專員已收到您的資訊，將於 24 小時內專人與您聯繫安排 30 天 Enterprise 企業試用環境！');\n      closeTrialModal();\n    }\n\n    const modelData = {\n      claude: {\n        title: \"Anthropic Claude 3.5 Sonnet\",\n        desc: \"擅長極複雜的代碼邏輯推理、大型專案重構與長文本脈絡理解。可以直接在 JetBrains IDE 編輯器對話框中隨時選用，免去切換工具的麻煩。\"\n      },\n      gpt: {\n        title: \"OpenAI GPT-4o\",\n        desc: \"多模態與快速代碼生成首選。適合日常通用編程、邏輯解答與自動化腳本寫作，與 JetBrains PSI 引擎完美配合。\"\n      },\n      gemini: {\n        title: \"Google Gemini 1.5 Pro\",\n        desc: \"超長 Context Window。適合處理大型遺留系統分析、跨檔案調用鏈排查與廣泛文檔理解。\"\n      },\n      mellum: {\n        title: \"JetBrains Mellum (自研專屬模型)\",\n        desc: \"專為極速代碼補全與 IDE 上下文設計。延遲極低、消耗積分少，專門處理編輯器內的微秒級程式碼自動補全。\"\n      }\n    };\n\n    function switchModel(modelKey) {\n      document.querySelectorAll('.model-btn').forEach(btn => {\n        btn.classList.remove('active', 'bg-indigo-600/20', 'border-indigo-500', 'text-white');\n        btn.classList.add('bg-slate-800/60', 'border-slate-700', 'text-slate-300');\n      });\n\n      const activeBtn = document.getElementById(`btn-${modelKey}`);\n      activeBtn.classList.remove('bg-slate-800/60', 'border-slate-700', 'text-slate-300');\n      activeBtn.classList.add('active', 'bg-indigo-600/20', 'border-indigo-500', 'text-white');\n\n      document.getElementById('model-title').textContent = modelData[modelKey].title;\n      document.getElementById('model-desc').textContent = modelData[modelKey].desc;\n    }\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","Description":"建立迪凱科技專屬：JetBrains AI Assistant 企業介紹與評估線上網站 (Web Portal / Landing Page)，包含互動模型切換、資安驗證、服務對比與在線試用申請表單。","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\User\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\cebfe850-edaa-4bde-aa18-447bd515eeb1/dekai_jetbrains_ai_portal.html","toolAction":"Creating standalone Web Portal landing page","toolSummary":"Write web portal HTML artifact"}}]}
