{"step_index":38,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-31T14:56:21Z","content":"**這是一個極具商業眼光與轉換率的絕妙想法！** 💡\n\n將這整套內容打包成一個**「互動式產品介紹與企業評估網站 (Web Portal / Landing Page)」**，比起傳統發送 PPT 簡報檔或 PDF，有以下幾個強大的戰略優勢：\n\n### 🚀 為什麼用「網站 Portal」發給客戶效果更好？\n\n1. **跨裝置極速傳播，無檔案限制**：\n   * 客戶不論是用電腦、iPad 還是手機點開連結就能立即閱讀，不用擔心郵件附件被公司防火牆擋掉，也不需要安裝 PowerPoint。\n2. **高階決策者互動體驗大幅提升**：\n   * **CISO / 資安長** 可以在網站上直接點擊連結，驗證 [JetBrains Official Trust Center](https://trust-center.jetbrains.com/)。\n   * **CTO / 工程主管** 可以點擊互動選單，體驗切換 Claude 3.5 Sonnet、GPT-4o 與 Gemini 等模型。\n   * **財務與採購主管** 能一眼看到 Central Console 的集中計費與迪凱科技的在地發票優勢。\n3. **自帶轉換管道（Lead Generation）**：\n   * 網站底部與導覽列直接內建**「申請 30 天 Enterprise 企業試用」**表單，客戶看完意願極高時，可以直接在網頁上填表預約！\n\n---\n\n### 🌐 我已為你生成好的「迪凱科技 專屬網頁 Portal」：\n\n你可以直接點擊下方連結開啟預覽：\n\n👉 **[dekai_jetbrains_ai_portal.html](file:///C:/Users/User/.gemini/antigravity/brain/cebfe850-edaa-4bde-aa18-447bd515eeb1/dekai_jetbrains_ai_portal.html)**\n\n---\n\n### 🌟 網站包裝包含的核心模組：\n\n1. **Hero 主視覺區**：訴求「高風控企業專用 AI 開發生態」，亮出四大 Trust Badges（零訓練、SOC 2、控制/數據面分離、台灣在地發票）。\n2. **IDE 靜態代碼分析 (PSI) 展示區**：說明如何杜絕 AI 幻覺與上下文丟失。\n3. **互動式多模型切換 Demo**：客戶點擊按鈕可動態切換 Claude 3.5 Sonnet / GPT-4o / Gemini / Mellum 說明。\n4. **🛡️ 企業資安與 Trust Center 門戶**：直連 `https://trust-center.jetbrains.com/` 原廠背書。\n5. **迪凱科技 (DeKai) 在地 6 大代理服務價值**：凸顯無須帳密、零最低限制、台幣發票與集中 Central 部署。\n6. **在線企業試用申請彈窗 (Modal Form)**：客戶可直接填寫公司名稱、聯絡人與評估人數。\n\n這個網頁檔案未來可以直接佈署在貴公司的官網或雲端主機上，隨時發給客戶進行 Pitch 與導流！"}
{"step_index":39,"source":"USER_EXPLICIT","type":"USER_INPUT","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-31T15:01:33Z","content":"<USER_REQUEST>\n以下幾點優化：\n將＂目錄中＂的每個大類分別做成＂快捷按鈕＂可以直接引導到頁面的區段\n並且做成半隱藏式頁面．客戶要看完成的要點開才可以看到完整內容說明\n先完成這一步\n每一段的內容的樣式我們再來慢慢優化調整\n\n\n</USER_REQUEST>\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\nThe current local time is: 2026-08-31T23:01:33+08:00.\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>"}
{"step_index":40,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-31T15:01:33Z","thinking":"**Implementing Quick Navigation**\n\nI'm currently focused on implementing quick-nav buttons for the major categories. My aim is to create interactive buttons for the table of contents that will smoothly scroll to the corresponding section of the page. This will improve user experience by making navigation more intuitive.\n\n\n**Refining Section Visibility**\n\nI'm now implementing collapsible sections. The initial view will show concise headers; users will expand each section to reveal the complete explanation and links. The focus is to get this functionality working, and then we'll address the style of the content blocks later on. I'm building out quick-nav buttons for each of the six major sections plus the conclusion in the directory index.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"更新迪凱科技網站 Portal：完成「目錄快捷按鈕導引」與「半隱藏摺疊展開式 (Accordion)」功能，點擊目錄可跳轉並自動展開完整內容。","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-TW\" class=\"scroll-smooth\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>JetBrains AI Assistant 企業級開發助手 - 迪凱科技 DeKai Technology</title>\n  <script src=\"https://www.gstatic.com/antigravity/web/dev/tailwindcss.min.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap');\n    body {\n      font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n    }\n    .accordion-content {\n      transition: max-height 0.4s ease, opacity 0.4s ease;\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n    .accordion-closed {\n      max-height: 0 !important;\n      opacity: 0;\n      padding-top: 0 !important;\n      padding-bottom: 0 !important;\n      margin-top: 0 !important;\n      pointer-events: none;\n    }\n    .accordion-open {\n      max-height: 2000px !important;\n      opacity: 1;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 antialiased selection:bg-indigo-500 selection:text-white\">\n\n  <!-- Navigation Bar -->\n  <nav class=\"fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50 bg-slate-950/85 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-slate-800/80\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 h-16 flex items-center justify-between\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n        <div class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-500 via-purple-500 to-pink-500 flex items-center justify-center font-black text-white text-lg shadow-lg shadow-indigo-500/20\">\n          JB\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <span class=\"font-extrabold text-base text-white tracking-tight\">JetBrains AI Assistant</span>\n          <span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500/10 text-indigo-400 border border-indigo-500/30 ml-2 hidden sm:inline-block\">台灣官方代理 迪凱科技</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n        <a href=\"https://trust-center.jetbrains.com/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"hidden sm:flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-slate-300 hover:text-white border border-slate-700 hover:border-slate-600 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg transition-all\">\n          <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-400\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z\"></path></svg>\n          Trust Center 驗證\n        </a>\n        <button onclick=\"openTrialModal()\" class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 text-white font-semibold text-xs transition-all shadow-md shadow-indigo-600/30\">\n          申請 30 天企業試用\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </nav>\n\n  <!-- Hero Section -->\n  <section class=\"pt-28 pb-12 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto text-center relative\">\n    <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500/10 border border-indigo-500/30 text-indigo-300 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4\">\n      <span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse\"></span>\n      高風控企業專用 AI 開發生態\n    </div>\n    <h1 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-white tracking-tight leading-tight mb-4\">\n      JetBrains AI Assistant <span class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-400 via-purple-300 to-pink-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent\">企業級介紹 Portal</span>\n    </h1>\n    <p class=\"text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-6\">\n      點選下方目錄按鈕，即可跳轉至對應單元並展開詳細規格、數據比較與原廠官方驗證說明。\n    </p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Section: Table of Contents / Directory Index (快捷導覽按鈕區) -->\n  <section id=\"directory-nav\" class=\"pb-12 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto sticky top-16 z-40 bg-slate-950/90 py-4 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-slate-800/80\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-3\">\n      <div class=\"text-xs font-bold text-indigo-400 uppercase tracking-widest flex items-center gap-2\">\n        <svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h7\"></path></svg>\n        簡報大綱快捷目錄 (點擊自動引導與展開)\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n        <button onclick=\"expandAllSections()\" class=\"text-[11px] px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 border border-slate-700 transition-all\">\n          全部展開 📂\n        </button>\n        <button onclick=\"collapseAllSections()\" class=\"text-[11px] px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 border border-slate-700 transition-all\">\n          全部摺疊 📁\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Quick Nav Buttons Grid -->\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-2.5\">\n      <button onclick=\"navigateToSection('sec-1')\" class=\"nav-btn group p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 hover:bg-indigo-600/20 border border-slate-800 hover:border-indigo-500/50 text-left transition-all\">\n        <div class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-indigo-400 group-hover:text-indigo-300\">01. 產品簡介</div>\n        <div class=\"text-xs font-bold text-white truncate\">市場驗證與比較</div>\n      </button>\n\n      <button onclick=\"navigateToSection('sec-2')\" class=\"nav-btn group p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 hover:bg-indigo-600/20 border border-slate-800 hover:border-indigo-500/50 text-left transition-all\">\n        <div class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-purple-400 group-hover:text-purple-300\">02. 產品優勢</div>\n        <div class=\"text-xs font-bold text-white truncate\">PSI 靜態分析防幻覺</div>\n      </button>\n\n      <button onclick=\"navigateToSection('sec-3')\" class=\"nav-btn group p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 hover:bg-indigo-600/20 border border-slate-800 hover:border-indigo-500/50 text-left transition-all\">\n        <div class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-pink-400 group-hover:text-pink-300\">03. 計費優勢</div>\n        <div class=\"text-xs font-bold text-white truncate\">多模型自由切換</div>\n      </button>\n\n      <button onclick=\"navigateToSection('sec-4')\" class=\"nav-btn group p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 hover:bg-indigo-600/20 border border-slate-800 hover:border-indigo-500/50 text-left transition-all\">\n        <div class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-emerald-400 group-hover:text-emerald-300\">04. 帳務優勢</div>\n        <div class=\"text-xs font-bold text-white truncate\">Central Console 配額</div>\n      </button>\n\n      <button onclick=\"navigateToSection('sec-5')\" class=\"nav-btn group p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 hover:bg-indigo-600/20 border border-slate-800 hover:border-indigo-500/50 text-left transition-all\">\n        <div class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-amber-400 group-hover:text-amber-300\">05. 安全聲明</div>\n        <div class=\"text-xs font-bold text-white truncate\">Trust Center 權威驗證</div>\n      </button>\n\n      <button onclick=\"navigateToSection('sec-6')\" class=\"nav-btn group p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 hover:bg-indigo-600/20 border border-slate-800 hover:border-indigo-500/50 text-left transition-all\">\n        <div class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-sky-400 group-hover:text-sky-300\">06. 代理服務</div>\n        <div class=\"text-xs font-bold text-white truncate\">迪凱在地 6 大價值</div>\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Main Content Sections (半隱藏 / 摺疊展開式 Accordions) -->\n  <main class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8 space-y-6\">\n\n    <!-- SECTION 1 -->\n    <section id=\"sec-1\" class=\"bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden transition-all shadow-xl\">\n      <!-- Section Header Bar (點擊切換) -->\n      <div onclick=\"toggleSection('sec-1')\" class=\"p-6 cursor-pointer hover:bg-slate-800/40 flex items-center justify-between transition-colors border-b border-slate-800/60 select-none\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n          <span class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-indigo-500/20 border border-indigo-500/30 text-indigo-400 font-extrabold text-sm flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\">\n            01\n          </span>\n          <div>\n            <span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-indigo-400 uppercase tracking-widest\">第一段：產品簡介</span>\n            <h2 class=\"text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-white\">JetBrains AI Assistant 是什麼？高風控市場驗證與對比</h2>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n          <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium hidden sm:inline-block\">點擊展開說明</span>\n          <div id=\"sec-1-icon\" class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-slate-300 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold transition-transform duration-300\">\n            ▼\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Section Expandable Body -->\n      <div id=\"sec-1-content\" class=\"accordion-content accordion-closed p-6 space-y-6 bg-slate-950/50\">\n        <p class=\"text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed\">\n          JetBrains IDE（IntelliJ IDEA, PyCharm, WebStorm, GoLand, Rider 等）在全台灣與全球各大金融機構、半導體龍頭、證券公司及高風控環境中，早已是不可或缺的標準開發工具。\n        </p>\n\n        <!-- Highlights Grid -->\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 text-xs\">\n          <div class=\"bg-slate-900 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-800\">\n            <div class=\"text-indigo-400 font-black text-lg mb-1\">90%+</div>\n            <h3 class=\"text-white font-bold mb-1\">金融與證券市場佔有率</h3>\n            <p class=\"text-slate-400\">通過最嚴苛的企業 IT 資安審查。</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bg-slate-900 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-800\">\n            <div class=\"text-purple-400 font-black text-lg mb-1\">20+ 年</div>\n            <h3 class=\"text-white font-bold mb-1\">靜態分析經驗積澱</h3>\n            <p class=\"text-slate-400\">具備全球最頂尖的抽象語法樹 (PSI) 能力。</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bg-slate-900 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-800\">\n            <div class=\"text-pink-400 font-black text-lg mb-1\">100%</div>\n            <h3 class=\"text-white font-bold mb-1\">企業合規與安全架構</h3>\n            <p class=\"text-slate-400\">提供 SOC 2 Type II、GDPR 認證與離線模式。</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Comparison Table -->\n        <div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n          <table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs border-collapse\">\n            <thead>\n              <tr class=\"bg-slate-900 border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-300\">\n                <th class=\"p-3 font-bold\">比較維度</th>\n                <th class=\"p-3 font-bold text-amber-300\">輕量外掛 / 獨立 CLI (如 Claude Code)</th>\n                <th class=\"p-3 font-bold text-indigo-300\">JetBrains AI Assistant 平台</th>\n              </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-slate-800/60 text-slate-300\">\n              <tr>\n                <td class=\"p-3 font-semibold text-white\">專案上下文理解</td>\n                <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-400\">僅文字檔檢索，易遺漏跨檔案繼承</td>\n                <td class=\"p-3 font-semibold text-indigo-300\">PSI 抽象語法樹 + 全專案符號索引</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td class=\"p-3 font-semibold text-white\">介面與審查</td>\n                <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-400\">純命令行 (CLI)，需手動切換視窗</td>\n                <td class=\"p-3 font-semibold text-indigo-300\">IDE 原生二元 Diff 審查與一鍵替換</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td class=\"p-3 font-semibold text-white\">模型選擇</td>\n                <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-400\">綁定單一模型供應商</td>\n                <td class=\"p-3 font-semibold text-indigo-300\">內建 Claude 3.5 / GPT-4o / Gemini 切換</td>\n              </tr>\n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between pt-3 border-t border-slate-800/80 text-xs\">\n          <span class=\"text-slate-400\">原廠背書連結：</span>\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n            <a href=\"https://www.jetbrains.com/enterprise/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-indigo-400 hover:underline\">JetBrains Enterprise Solutions 🔗</a>\n            <a href=\"https://www.jetbrains.com/case-studies/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-indigo-400 hover:underline\">Customer Case Studies 🔗</